{"suttaId":"ps1.0","source":{"db":"E-Piṭaka (dhammanana/epitaka_app)","book":"Paṭis","vriCode":"s0517m.mul","paras":[6,80],"vripara":"1"},"segments":{"ps1.0:0.4":"Mātikā","ps1.0:1.1":"Sotāvadhāne paññā sutamaye ñāṇaṃ. 2.","ps1.0:2.1":"Sutvāna saṃvare paññā sīlamaye ñāṇaṃ. 3.","ps1.0:3.1":"Saṃvaritvā samādahane paññā samādhibhāvanāmaye ñāṇaṃ. 4.","ps1.0:4.1":"Paccayapariggahe paññā dhammaṭṭhitiñāṇaṃ. 5.","ps1.0:5.1":"Atītānāgatapaccuppannānaṃ dhammānaṃ saṅkhipitvā vavatthāne paññā sammasane ñāṇaṃ. 6.","ps1.0:6.1":"Paccuppannānaṃ dhammānaṃ vipariṇāmānupassane paññā udayabbayānupassane ñāṇaṃ. 7.","ps1.0:7.1":"Ārammaṇaṃ paṭisaṅkhā bhaṅgānupassane paññā vipassane ñāṇaṃ. 8.","ps1.0:8.1":"Bhayatupaṭṭhāne paññā ādīnave ñāṇaṃ. 9.","ps1.0:9.1":"Muñcitukamyatāpaṭisaṅkhāsantiṭṭhanā paññā saṅkhārupekkhāsu ñāṇaṃ. 10.","ps1.0:10.1":"Bahiddhā vuṭṭhānavivaṭṭane paññā gotrabhuñāṇaṃ. 11.","ps1.0:11.1":"Dubhato vuṭṭhānavivaṭṭane paññā magge ñāṇaṃ. 12.","ps1.0:12.1":"Payogappaṭippassaddhi paññā phale ñāṇaṃ. 13.","ps1.0:13.1":"Chinnavaṭumānupassane [chinnamanupassane (syā.), chinnavaṭṭamanupassane (sī. aṭṭha.)] paññā vimuttiñāṇaṃ. 14.","ps1.0:14.1":"Tadā samudāgate [samupāgate (syā.)] dhamme passane paññā paccavekkhaṇe ñāṇaṃ. 15.","ps1.0:15.1":"Ajjhattavavatthāne paññā vatthunānatte ñāṇaṃ. 16.","ps1.0:16.1":"Bahiddhāvavatthāne paññā gocaranānatte ñāṇaṃ. 17.","ps1.0:17.1":"Cariyāvavatthāne paññā cariyānānatte ñāṇaṃ. 18.","ps1.0:18.1":"Catudhammavavatthāne paññā bhūminānatte ñāṇaṃ. 19.","ps1.0:19.1":"Navadhammavavatthāne paññā dhammanānatte ñāṇaṃ. 20.","ps1.0:20.1":"Abhiññāpaññā ñātaṭṭhe ñāṇaṃ. 21.","ps1.0:21.1":"Pariññāpaññā tīraṇaṭṭhe ñāṇaṃ. 22.","ps1.0:22.1":"Pahāne paññā pariccāgaṭṭhe ñāṇaṃ. 23.","ps1.0:23.1":"Bhāvanāpaññā ekarasaṭṭhe ñāṇaṃ. 24.","ps1.0:24.1":"Sacchikiriyāpaññā phassanaṭṭhe [phusanaṭṭhe (ka.)] ñāṇaṃ. 25.","ps1.0:25.1":"Atthanānatte paññā atthapaṭisambhide ñāṇaṃ. 26.","ps1.0:26.1":"Dhammanānatte paññā dhammapaṭisambhide ñāṇaṃ. 27.","ps1.0:27.1":"Niruttinānatte paññā niruttipaṭisambhide ñāṇaṃ. 28.","ps1.0:28.1":"Paṭibhānanānatte paññā [paṭibhāṇanānatte (syā.)] paṭibhānapaṭisambhide ñāṇaṃ. 29.","ps1.0:29.1":"Vihāranānatte paññā vihāraṭṭhe ñāṇaṃ. 30.","ps1.0:30.1":"Samāpattinānatte paññā samāpattaṭṭhe ñāṇaṃ. 31.","ps1.0:31.1":"Vihārasamāpattinānatte paññā vihārasamāpattaṭṭhe ñāṇaṃ. 32.","ps1.0:32.1":"Avikkhepaparisuddhattā āsavasamucchede paññā ānantarikasamādhimhi ñāṇaṃ. 33.","ps1.0:33.1":"Dassanādhipateyyaṃ santo ca vihārādhigamo paṇītādhimuttatā paññā araṇavihāre ñāṇaṃ. 34.","ps1.0:34.1":"Dvīhi balehi samannāgatattā tayo ca saṅkhārānaṃ paṭippassaddhiyā soḷasahi ñāṇacariyāhi navahi samādhicariyāhi vasibhāvatā paññā nirodhasamāpattiyā ñāṇaṃ. 35.","ps1.0:35.1":"Sampajānassa pavattapariyādāne paññā parinibbāne ñāṇaṃ. 36.","ps1.0:36.1":"Sabbadhammānaṃ sammā samucchede nirodhe ca anupaṭṭhānatā paññā samasīsaṭṭhe ñāṇaṃ. 37.","ps1.0:37.1":"Puthunānattatejapariyādāne paññā sallekhaṭṭhe ñāṇaṃ. 38.","ps1.0:38.1":"Asallīnattapahitattapaggahaṭṭhe paññā vīriyārambhe ñāṇaṃ. 39.","ps1.0:39.1":"Nānādhammappakāsanatā paññā atthasandassane ñāṇaṃ. 40.","ps1.0:40.1":"Sabbadhammānaṃ ekasaṅgahatānānattekattapaṭivedhe paññā dassanavisuddhiñāṇaṃ. 41.","ps1.0:41.1":"Viditattā paññā khantiñāṇaṃ. 42.","ps1.0:42.1":"Phuṭṭhattā paññā pariyogāhaṇe [pariyogāhane (syā.)] ñāṇaṃ. 43.","ps1.0:43.1":"Samodahane paññā padesavihāre ñāṇaṃ. 44.","ps1.0:44.1":"Adhipatattā paññā saññāvivaṭṭe ñāṇaṃ. 45.","ps1.0:45.1":"Nānatte paññā cetovivaṭṭe ñāṇaṃ. 46.","ps1.0:46.1":"Adhiṭṭhāne paññā cittavivaṭṭe ñāṇaṃ. 47.","ps1.0:47.1":"Suññate paññā ñāṇavivaṭṭe ñāṇaṃ. 48.","ps1.0:48.1":"Vosagge [vossagge (bahūsu)] paññā vimokkhavivaṭṭe ñāṇaṃ. 49.","ps1.0:49.1":"Tathaṭṭhe paññā saccavivaṭṭe ñāṇaṃ. 50.","ps1.0:50.1":"Kāyampi cittampi ekavavatthānatā sukhasaññañca lahusaññañca adhiṭṭhānavasena ijjhanaṭṭhe paññā iddhividhe ñāṇaṃ. 51.","ps1.0:51.1":"Vitakkavipphāravasena nānattekattasaddanimittānaṃ pariyogāhaṇe paññā sotadhātuvisuddhiñāṇaṃ. 52.","ps1.0:52.1":"Tiṇṇannaṃ cittānaṃ vipphārattā indriyānaṃ pasādavasena nānattekattaviññāṇacariyā pariyogāhaṇe paññā cetopariyañāṇaṃ. 53.","ps1.0:53.1":"Paccayappavattānaṃ dhammānaṃ nānattekattakammavipphāravasena pariyogāhaṇe paññā pubbenivāsānussatiñāṇaṃ. 54.","ps1.0:54.1":"Obhāsavasena nānattekattarūpanimittānaṃ dassanaṭṭhe paññā dibbacakkhuñāṇaṃ. 55.","ps1.0:55.1":"Catusaṭṭhiyā ākārehi tiṇṇannaṃ indriyānaṃ vasībhāvatā paññā āsavānaṃ khaye ñāṇaṃ. 56.","ps1.0:56.1":"Pariññaṭṭhe paññā dukkhe ñāṇaṃ. 57.","ps1.0:57.1":"Pahānaṭṭhe paññā samudaye ñāṇaṃ. 58.","ps1.0:58.1":"Sacchikiriyaṭṭhe paññā nirodhe ñāṇaṃ. 59.","ps1.0:59.1":"Bhāvanaṭṭhe paññā magge ñāṇaṃ. 60.","ps1.0:60.1":"Dukkhe ñāṇaṃ. 61.","ps1.0:61.1":"Dukkhasamudaye ñāṇaṃ. 62.","ps1.0:62.1":"Dukkhanirodhe ñāṇaṃ. 63.","ps1.0:63.1":"Dukkhanirodhagāminiyā paṭipadāya ñāṇaṃ. 64.","ps1.0:64.1":"Atthapaṭisambhide ñāṇaṃ. 65.","ps1.0:65.1":"Dhammapaṭisambhide ñāṇaṃ. 66.","ps1.0:66.1":"Niruttipaṭisambhide ñāṇaṃ. 67.","ps1.0:67.1":"Paṭibhānapaṭisambhide ñāṇaṃ. 68.","ps1.0:68.1":"Indriyaparopariyatte ñāṇaṃ. 69.","ps1.0:69.1":"Sattānaṃ āsayānusaye ñāṇaṃ. 70.","ps1.0:70.1":"Yamakapāṭihīre ñāṇaṃ. 71.","ps1.0:71.1":"Mahākaruṇāsamāpattiyā ñāṇaṃ. 72.","ps1.0:72.1":"Sabbaññutañāṇaṃ. 73.","ps1.0:73.1":"Anāvaraṇañāṇaṃ.","ps1.0:74.1":"Imāni tesattati ñāṇāni.","ps1.0:74.2":"Imesaṃ tesattatiyā ñāṇānaṃ sattasaṭṭhi ñāṇāni sāvakasādhāraṇāni;","ps1.0:74.3":"cha ñāṇāni asādhāraṇāni sāvakehi.","ps1.0:74.4":"Mātikā niṭṭhitā. 1."},"unsure":[],"preface":["Namo tassa bhagavato arahato sammāsambuddhassa"],"attha":null,"tika":null,"tika2":null}
